Son exploit consiste à:";s:18:"questiontextformat";s:1:"1";s:15:"generalfeedback";s:508:"Alberto Santos-Dumont est le premier à posséder les trois brevets de pilote : ballon, dirigeable et aéroplane. Inventeur partageant volontiers ses découvertes, il conçoit un petit dirigeable avec lequel il atterrit régulièrement devant la porte de son immeuble à Paris. En 1908 il conçoit un avion très maniable de 56 kg, la "Demoiselle" qui, construit en série, deviendra la vedette des exhibitions publiques.<br><img src='https://bia-caea.fr/images/Santos-Dumont.jpg' alt='Image de la solution'>";s:21:"generalfeedbackformat";s:1:"1";s:11:"defaultmark";d:1;s:7:"penalty";d:0.3333333;s:5:"qtype";s:11:"multichoice";s:6:"length";s:1:"1";s:5:"stamp";s:33:"bia-facile.fr+241120143228+RzmJxE";s:11:"timecreated";s:10:"1732113148";s:12:"timemodified";s:10:"1732113148";s:9:"createdby";s:1:"2";s:10:"modifiedby";s:1:"2";s:8:"idnumber";N;s:9:"contextid";s:3:"803";s:6:"status";s:5:"ready";s:9:"versionid";s:4:"8641";s:7:"version";s:1:"1";s:19:"questionbankentryid";s:4:"8636";s:14:"categoryobject";O:8:"stdClass":9:{s:2:"id";s:3:"506";s:4:"name";s:54:"Histoire et culture de l’aéronautique et du spatial";s:9:"contextid";s:3:"803";s:4:"info";s:0:"";s:10:"infoformat";s:1:"0";s:5:"stamp";s:33:"bia-facile.fr+241120143228+LdjUgL";s:6:"parent";s:3:"501";s:9:"sortorder";s:3:"999";s:8:"idnumber";N;}s:7:"options";O:8:"stdClass":15:{s:2:"id";s:4:"8641";s:10:"questionid";s:4:"8641";s:6:"layout";s:1:"0";s:6:"single";s:1:"1";s:14:"shuffleanswers";s:1:"0";s:15:"correctfeedback";s:0:"";s:21:"correctfeedbackformat";s:1:"1";s:24:"partiallycorrectfeedback";s:0:"";s:30:"partiallycorrectfeedbackformat";s:1:"1";s:17:"incorrectfeedback";s:0:"";s:23:"incorrectfeedbackformat";s:1:"1";s:15:"answernumbering";s:3:"abc";s:14:"shownumcorrect";s:1:"0";s:23:"showstandardinstruction";s:1:"1";s:7:"answers";a:4:{i:32814;O:8:"stdClass":7:{s:2:"id";s:5:"32814";s:8:"question";s:4:"8641";s:6:"answer";s:46:"contourner la tour Eiffel en bal